  <h3>Simple router policies against the oracle</h3>
  <p>Each policy is a fixed rule that picks one cell per session without any model. It reads only the user's choice and, for the last rule, the length of the first message. The measures are the ones defined in <a href="#scoring">Scoring a router</a>.</p>
